{"id": "138", "question": "what is the treatment when asset is discarded as per income tax act", "gt": "Based on the Income Tax Act, when an asset is discarded but not sold, the scrap value of the asset can be reduced from the block in the previous year in which the asset is discarded as per section 43(6). This is done under the block concept, where all assets of the same class and subject to the same rate of depreciation are considered as a single asset. Any changes to the block's value must abide by the provisions of Chapter IV D of the Income Tax Act, 1961. Additionally, the assessee can claim depreciation on the residual value of such discarded asset, even if it's not used for the purposes of business or profession in that year and subsequent years.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to analyze the given passages to determine the treatment of an asset when it is discarded as per the Income Tax Act. However, I notice that no actual passages were provided in your query. Without the specific text passages to analyze, I cannot perform the required step-by-step reasoning or extract any details about asset disposal treatment under the Income Tax Act.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nI need to analyze the given passages to determine the treatment of an asset when it is discarded as per the Income Tax Act. However, I notice that no actual passages were provided in your query. Without the specific text passages to analyze, I cannot perform the required step-by-step reasoning or extract any details about asset disposal treatment under the Income Tax Act. Unable to answer based on given passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 167.928, "generation_time_seconds": 136.6006, "selection_time_seconds": 31.3191, "nemotron": {"method": "gd", "step_beam_size": 2, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 2.56, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "139", "question": "what is the treatment when asset is discarded as per income tax act", "gt": "Based on the given passages, when an asset is discarded but not sold, the scrap value of the asset can be reduced from the block in the previous year in which the asset is discarded. The block concept is followed, where assets of the same class and subject to the same rate of depreciation are grouped together and considered as a single asset. The assessee is entitled to claim depreciation on the residual value of the discarded asset, even if it is not used for business or profession in that year and subsequent years.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to see the given passages to analyze the physical details step by step. Without the actual text passages about the Income Tax Act and asset disposal, I cannot perform the required analysis. Please provide the specific passages you want me to examine.\nI need to see the given passages to analyze the physical details step by step. Without the actual text passages about the Income Tax Act and asset disposal, I cannot perform the required analysis. Please provide the specific passages you want me to examine.\nI need to see the given passages to analyze the physical details step by step. Without the actual text passages about the Income Tax Act and asset disposal, I cannot perform the required analysis. Please provide the specific passages you want me to examine.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 173.037, "generation_time_seconds": 142.2917, "selection_time_seconds": 30.7434, "nemotron": {"method": "gd", "step_beam_size": 2, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "S