{"id": "142", "question": "what is the treatment when asset is discarded as per income tax act", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the treatment for an asset that is discarded as per the Income Tax Act is as follows:\n\nThe scrap value of the asset can be reduced from the block in the previous year in which the asset is discarded, as per Section 43(6) of the Income Tax Act. The block concept applies to all assets falling within the same class and subject to the same rate of depreciation, and any alterations to the value of the block must be made in accordance with the provisions of Chapter IV D of the Income Tax Act. The assessee can claim depreciation on the residual value of the discarded asset (i.e., opening WDV of such asset less scrap value) even if the asset is not used for business or professional purposes in that year or subsequent years.\n\nTherefore, the treatment for an asset that is discarded as per the Income Tax Act is to reduce the scrap value from the block in the previous year and claim depreciation on the residual value.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of an asset when it is discarded according to the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any specific passages provided in your question. Without the actual text passages to analyze, I cannot determine what information they contain about asset disposal treatment under the Income Tax Act.\nI need the actual passages containing information about the Income Tax Act's treatment of discarded assets to analyze. Please provide the specific text passages for me to examine.\nI need the actual text passages containing information about the Income Tax Act's treatment of discarded assets to analyze. Please provide the specific passages for examination.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 190.887, "generation_time_seconds": 158.1035, "selection_time_seconds": 32.7817, "nemotron": {"method": "gd", "step_beam_size": 2, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.66, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
